    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ahiya gang'uchi sea Yeroboamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gweaydeaba damasis bea sugoocheanda was Yeroboamu. Ghang'eat Abiya goombal Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goombaliischi gweanyeew samwagu aba Yerusalemu. Gheawunga ghaamwat geeguura Mikaya was hudeaba Urieli bea ng'eanyiida Gibeya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eat Abiya gawa gang'uchi nea gaba shirikarajeega daruusi bea ng'ucheeda, fih sagalamnyooji bughalaji ang'wan; ng'ata gwasin Yeroboamu lugweagaaschi jea gang'uchi sea Ahiya was shirikaraji sagalamnyooji bughalaji sis was gheareemanga meanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghamiinaada Ahiya aba uhuuda giijeeda Semaraimu mida jeeda heayeeniga ng'eanyiida Efraimu, ak gwayi, “Aleeysean iita, Ea Yeroboamu ea fuga sean bea Israeli! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agooga miyoanala gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA fuga Israeli ghayi ghoadaw Dawdi ea orjoagaaschi gheambalmeeda aba badayda fuga Israeli aba neajeeda balang'da? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak Yeroboamooda was orjeeda Nebati, was siida gadiyeeda bea Sulemani was orjeeda Dawdi, ghamiinaada ak goofuurji geaw siidaanyi haw; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'ata ghabwada geat fuga munyas manda gadiyeeda ak gwadiing'sa Rehoboameeda was orjeeda Sulemani gidagasa saawa damanda gudea mwanang' nea abeeda ea miighoamu ghaweat geaw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak ghamneawa iyoong'ulayi gajoamuusa oateala gheambalmeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, aba jeeda geatinga orjooga Dawdi, aba gideaba goowooschi eemeetuw nea goondeawi meayda ghayi sineegwa Yeroboamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heapi miyoahoana ashoohoodiga NG'UTAMIIDA, was orjooga Haruni, ea fuga Lawi, ak goosisi geat ashoohoodiga gawuurji gida sina fuga bea ng'eanyoojiga suuk? Siisi jea ghoamu ghoamiidu geaw aba heew mwanang' ghana lagweendi ispwa gayghoah ashoohoocheanda gea mawoosa aseecheeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak aba heedeanya NG'UTAMIIDA ASEETEANYA gil, nea miyeenung'wana heeda. Nea geendeawi ashoohoodiga gadiyeesa NG'UTAMIIDA, was orjooga Haruni, ea fuga Lawi aba gadiyeeda nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyeesa sakteayda ea shing'ada ghoadaw NG'UTAMIIDA haleanjeeda heeda wagiida sigwariida ea geediga ng'andidi, ea mukaatajeega giihiimnooda inyeesa ghwayiin badayda measeeda ghaydit, nea gafur hoorgeeda gheaboong'nyeanda sisina dahaabu, nea inyeesa gheaboonyangiga ghwayeat gilinyoo ea shing'ada; nea inyeesa aseasa geefurji haleanjeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYA, ak agooga ea noojakti niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak goong'ulayi, ASEETA geendeawi nea goosheedeaweesa, sea ashoohoodigaaschi ghuuda durumbeateeda ng'ucheeda jea goojuura iita ng'ucheeda sea agooga. Ea orjooga Israeli, adiidu goong'ucheewi NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA ghweanigeagwa; aba gideaba majoamuusa ajooriischeena.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Yeroboamu ea niijeakta lugooda gwaneaweesa saawa aba bwadaw; nea saawa gwanda madeeda Yuda, nea lugooda gwanda badahuuka nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ang'wearda Yuda, ging'ulayi, gwanda lugooda mwadi ea badahuuka nyaawa; ng'ata gooyeawusa NG'UTAMIIDA nea ghaghuut ashoohoodiga durumbeati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goojuur fuga Yuda. Hean nea goojuur fuga Yuda, hean ghabwar ASEETA Yeroboamu sea fuga sean bea Israeli aba madeeda Abiya sea Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gamng'awa fuga Israeli madeeda Yuda, ak ghwayiin ASEETA saawa geatinga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghabwar Abiya sea fugaaschi saawa aba bayiiga hees; ak gameewa fih sagalamnyooji bughalaji muut (500,000) was headiga sigwalu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nih gisijoarda fuga Israeli gil aba damandida, ak fuga Yuda gwajooriischi aba gideaba saawa gwaduukusa NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA ghweaniga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwaat Abiya geeshta Yeroboamu, ak ghoareat mujiinajeagaaschi, Beteli ea gharang'weakaaschi, ea Yeshinani sea gharang'weakaaschi, ea Efroni sea gharang'weakaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Yeroboamu ea mudu ghwanyas uurdaanyi damanda Abiya; ng'ata ghwalas gheata NG'UTAMIIDA ak ghami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwaheedu uurda Abiya, ak ghaghi gadeem damanang'wan ak gwaji orju diktam ea iyeenya ea haw damwalah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea haleanjeeda siipuut was gadiyoojiga, ea naweadinga ea ng'asheega Abiya, geeng'oorsa jeeda gununoonga sibaneeda siguura Ido.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
